{"id":"cb787bdb-77b3-40bc-96ab-a5e5a1abb948","createdAt":"2026-10-05 11:39 +02:00","priority":"Low","status":"Archived","description":"now that the format of Features is standard JSON lets mofify the storage, migrate to three file stores: .features .current .archived. The client lists should filter on the appropriate status. Archived Features get status Archived and are moved to .archive (we will worry later about how). The only other store is the ./DEVENVOPDEV.md file (which is the set of features actively being worked on)."}
