{"id":"aa6efa16-fbfe-4f7e-87ac-e53f80eabe91","createdAt":"2026-10-05 12:40 +02:00","priority":"Medium","status":"Archived","description":"[AI Question] .wishlist and .backlog no longer exist (merged into .features), so Done features cannot be on .wishlist anymore, but Done features now stay in .features (shown on the Done tab) until they are moved to .archived. Should Done features be moved out of .features to .archived (status Archived) on commit, instead of staying in .features? A: No, we will archive them manually (later) leave them in features with a relevant status"}
